  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Don't Get 2 Close 2 My Fantasy**: back after 43 archived shows (598 days) [2]\n- **israel**: back after 49 archived shows (750 days); rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Push th' Little Daisy**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Noncore**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Ween2018-11-04.MK012** (recommended): source not stated; 27 songs; 127 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The uploader places the show in St. Paul, Minnesota [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Ween2018-11-04.MK012**: taped by Zachariah Boes [1]. Also: Recorded with Octava MK-012-01 microphones using cards, feeding a Fostex FR2LE recorder at 24-bit/48kHz; Transfer path went from the Fostex FR2LE through Audacity and was encoded to FLAC [1]",
